00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,967
Every clock in town says six-forty.
The tower. The diner. The bank. The
watch on the mayor's wrist.

2
00:00:06,467 --> 00:00:11,533
Rule three. Trust your own watch. If
every clock agrees, something is
lying.

3
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:16,133
Your watch says nine twelve PM. You
check it twice. You check it again.
